  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/750/103/jewelry_full_1000.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>💍 深入地下寻找珍贵宝石，将它们打造成强大的珠宝首饰！</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"模组加载器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-法术引擎-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"SpellEngine\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;color=7389D8&amp;labelColor=6A7EC2&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><hr><h2>✨ 探索更多RPG系列模组</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"圣骑士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"巫师\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"游侠\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能树\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"军械库\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"盔甲库\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h1>📦 安装指南</h1><h3>必需模组</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-power\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">法术能量属性</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ranged-weapon-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">远程武器API</a></li>\n</ul><p>饰品槽模组（二选一）</p><ul>\n<li>Fabric端：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a>（不可同时安装！）</li>\n<li>NeoForge端：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a></li>\n</ul><h3>强烈推荐</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-roll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">战斗翻滚</a> - 部分首饰会提供翻滚加成</li>\n</ul><h1>💍 特色功能</h1><p>收集总计25+种不同的全新珠宝首饰！</p><p>每件首饰都会提供不同的战斗相关加成。</p><p>从前期的普通材料到终局的高级材料，总有适合你当前阶段的饰品可供获取。</p><h2>深入地下开采珍贵宝石</h2><p>宝石矿脉生成深度与钻石矿相同，但生成概率只有钻石矿的一半。</p><p>随机掉落6种新宝石中的一种。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/425/gem_vein.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>将宝石打造成强力首饰</h2><p>通过将宝石与金锭和下界合金锭组合，制作戒指和项链。</p><p>首饰的属性加成可在 <code>config/jewelry/items.json</code> 中配置。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/424/crafting.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>扩展地牢战利品</h2><p>在地牢宝箱中发现首饰。特殊地点（如末地城宝箱）会掉落非常特别的、独一无二的、无法制作的专属首饰。</p><p>战利品表注入可在 <code>config/jewelry/loot.json</code> 中配置。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/426/dungeon.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>新增村庄建筑</h2><p>在村庄中找到珠宝商店，可与珠宝商村民交易首饰和材料。</p><p>生成权重和数量限制可在 <code>config/jewelry/villages.json</code> 中配置。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/726/423/village.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><p>在终局战利品箱中发现独特（稀有）首饰（例如：末地城宝藏、远古城市宝藏…）</p><h1>为多人游戏设计</h1><p>创建属于你自己的RPG服务器。使用我们的优惠码可享受更低价格，同时也能支持我们。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"获取服务器\"></a></p><h1>🎁 想要更多内容？</h1><p>探索由我们亲爱的合作伙伴制作的各种法术引擎模组！</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"混乱\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"佣兵与工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手扩展（更多RPG职业）\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂战士（更多RPG职业）\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素巫师（更多RPG职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"原力大师（更多RPG职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"猎魔人（更多RPG职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡骑士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
